{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/deeplearning/4_face/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2>Face verification vs Face recognition</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Verification\n<ul>\n<li>Input = 이미지, 이름/ID</li>\n<li>Output = 권한이 있는 사람인가?</li>\n<li>1 : 1 대응</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Recognition\n<ul>\n<li>Input = 이미지</li>\n<li>Output = 이미지에 있는 K명의 ID</li>\n<li>K명의 데이터베이스를 가지고 있음. 1: K</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>One-shot Learning</h2>\n<p>단 하나의 이미지나 사진만 제시해도 그 사람을 알아차릴 수 있어야 한다.</p>\n<p>팀원 5명을 인식하는 모델을 만들었다고 하자. Output이 5개이다. 새로운 팀원 1명이 합류하면 Output을 6개로 늘이기 위해 새로 학습을 해야하는가? 비효율적이다. 이럴 때 유사함수를 사용한다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/a91f8/f1.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/a59e9/f1.webp 192w,\n/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/0ca9f/f1.webp 384w,\n/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/dc9b9/f1.webp 768w,\n/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/a6361/f1.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/3b721/f1.png 192w,\n/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/66595/f1.png 384w,\n/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/fe486/f1.png 768w,\n/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/a91f8/f1.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/6348e13847b866d9c61bceb148f96bb2/fe486/f1.png\"\n            alt=\"One-shot Learning\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>두 얼굴을 입력해서 얼마나 닮았는지, 얼마나 다른지 알려주는 함수 d</p>\n<p>d를 만들기 위해서 Siamese Network를 사욯한다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/a91f8/f2.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/a59e9/f2.webp 192w,\n/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/0ca9f/f2.webp 384w,\n/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/dc9b9/f2.webp 768w,\n/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/a6361/f2.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/3b721/f2.png 192w,\n/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/66595/f2.png 384w,\n/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/fe486/f2.png 768w,\n/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/a91f8/f2.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/62b7efdee26f2125ba4b29e048ae2a2f/fe486/f2.png\"\n            alt=\"One-shot Learning\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/a91f8/f3.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/a59e9/f3.webp 192w,\n/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/0ca9f/f3.webp 384w,\n/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/dc9b9/f3.webp 768w,\n/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/a6361/f3.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/3b721/f3.png 192w,\n/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/66595/f3.png 384w,\n/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/fe486/f3.png 768w,\n/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/a91f8/f3.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/0151a14bac2b5994ea59574c330c6c68/fe486/f3.png\"\n            alt=\"One-shot Learning\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Triple Loss</h2>\n<p>Anchor 이미지를 보고 Positive, Negative 예제를 짝지어 학습시킨다. 동시에 3가지 이미지를 보기 때문에 삼중항 손실이라고 부름.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/a91f8/f4.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/a59e9/f4.webp 192w,\n/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/0ca9f/f4.webp 384w,\n/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/dc9b9/f4.webp 768w,\n/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/a6361/f4.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/3b721/f4.png 192w,\n/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/66595/f4.png 384w,\n/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/fe486/f4.png 768w,\n/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/a91f8/f4.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/ee93c9b6ce3412f7dea1136e4ae070e3/fe486/f4.png\"\n            alt=\"Triple Loss\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>알파는 positive와 negative 기준값의 차이.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/a91f8/f5.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/a59e9/f5.webp 192w,\n/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/0ca9f/f5.webp 384w,\n/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/dc9b9/f5.webp 768w,\n/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/a6361/f5.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/3b721/f5.png 192w,\n/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/66595/f5.png 384w,\n/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/fe486/f5.png 768w,\n/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/a91f8/f5.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/52b00d7efd966f7310058bdd23cdacaf/fe486/f5.png\"\n            alt=\"Triple Loss\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>삼중항을 찾기 위해서는 경사하강을 통해 낮은 L을 찾아야 한다.</p>\n<p>삼중항 A,P,N을 선택하는 방법</p>\n<ul>\n<li>훈련 중에는 A,P,N이 랜덤하게 선택된다면 d(A,P) + a ≤ d(A,N)이 쉽게 만족된다.</li>\n<li>훈련하기 어려운 삼중항을 골라라. d(A,P)가 d(A,N)과 거의 같은 값,</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>Face Verification and Binary Classification</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/a91f8/f6.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.25%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/a59e9/f6.webp 192w,\n/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/0ca9f/f6.webp 384w,\n/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/dc9b9/f6.webp 768w,\n/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/a6361/f6.webp 960w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/3b721/f6.png 192w,\n/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/66595/f6.png 384w,\n/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/fe486/f6.png 768w,\n/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/a91f8/f6.png 960w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/492bd4004d34742a842a5c3f686020b9/fe486/f6.png\"\n            alt=\"Face Verification and Binary Classification\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>참고 자료</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/convolutional-neural-networks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coursera - Convolution Neural Networks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://brunch.co.kr/@aischool/11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YOLO(You Only Look Once) 모델 소개</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"DeepLearning - CNN Face Recognition","date":"2024.07.09.","categories":["DeepLearning"]}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/deeplearning/4_face/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}